sequenceDiagram
  actor U as User
  participant W as Review UI
  participant A as API
  participant D as SQLite
  W->>W: live validation (shared rules)
  U->>W: edit / confirm flagged fields
  U->>W: Approve & save
  W->>A: POST /api/bills {scanId, fields, confirmedFields, acknowledge*}
  A->>A: zod + validateBill(approved values)
  alt invalid values
    A-->>W: 422 validation_failed
  else warnings not acknowledged
    A-->>W: 409 validation_warnings
    U->>W: Save anyway
    W->>A: POST … acknowledgeWarnings=true
  else possible duplicate
    A-->>W: 409 possible_duplicate (+ matches)
    U->>W: Save both
  end
  A->>D: INSERT bill, line_items, corrections (diff vs AI), link images
  A-->>W: 201 bill (with per-field provenance)
  W-->>U: Bill detail page
